  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      650.29,
      537.98,
      697.36
    ],
    "text": "All that area of land containing in an extent of 121.4677 hectares and described as Lots Nos. A, C, E, H, J (excludingLot Nos. B, D, F, G) in the Surveyor General\u2019s Tracing No. Ma/MDU/2018/184 dated 27th November 2018, situated inthe village of Madhu, in the Grama Niladhari Division of Madhu (G. N. Div. No. MN/37), in the Divisional Secretary\u2019sDivision of Madhu, in the Administrative District of Mannar, in the Northen Province and bounded as follows :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
